From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 10:47:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] =?UTF-8?q?fix(tally):=20remove=20full-scan=20voucher?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20date=20filter=20=E2=80=94=20root=20cause=20of=20window=20tim?=
 =?UTF-8?q?eouts?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The explicit TDL FILTER ($Date >= ## AND $Date <= ##) forced Tally to
materialize and scan the ENTIRE voucher file on every window, which is why
1-month and 4-day windows timed out identically at 120s in the 2026-08-12
15:07 Force Full Sync. Voucher collections are period-bound: SVFROMDATE/
SVTODATE alone lets Tally serve the window from its date index. The
extractor keeps validating each voucher's DATE client-side.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DCJhVDhastfZJHdA7bJSnU
---
