From dfb68ca73d336a74fdf12000a50e0c208d59a851 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 10:47:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] feat(tally): voucher request budget + split-first timeout
 policy

- new tally.voucherTimeoutSeconds (default 300) gives heavy voucher windows
  a fair budget without slowing light master/report calls (still 120s);
  timeouts are now enforced per request via linked CTS
- multi-day voucher windows no longer retry a timeout at the same size
  (10/30/60s ladder = ~10 wasted minutes per identical heavy request);
  the engine splits immediately. Single-day windows keep the full ladder.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DCJhVDhastfZJHdA7bJSnU
